{"kind": "mod", "id": 1617, "name": "give-ui", "slug": "give-ui", "teaser": "Simple UI for the give, trader and profile commands", "owner_name": "agavalda", "downloads": 65639, "favourites": 43, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.agavalda.giveui", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Items", "category_id": 4, "updated_at": "2026-08-02T18:02:21.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-08-01T19:19:46.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-08-01T19:19:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1.0", "latest_version": "5.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/master/recording.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/master/recording.gif\" alt=\"recording.gif\" /></a></p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>- unzip it in your SPT root folder</p>\n<h2>Running</h2>\n<p>1. With the server and preferably with Tarkov running, open the app (inside SPT_Runtime/user/mods/give-ui folder)</p>\n<p>2. Use the form to connect to the server and select your character</p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<h3>Adding items</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/v2.2.0/items.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/v2.2.0/items.png\" alt=\"items.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>- Select the item you want to receive. The quantity, by default, is always set to the maximum stack size</p>\n<p>- You will receive a message with the item/s</p>\n<p>- Linked search</p>\n<h3>User weapons presets</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/v2.2.0/user-presets.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/v2.2.0/user-presets.png\" alt=\"user-presets.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>- When you have saved weapons presets you can add them to your character with a single click</p>\n<p>- You will receive a message with the weapon preset</p>\n<p>Kits</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/master/kits.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/master/kits.png\" alt=\"kits.png\" /></a></p>\n<h3>Stash</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/master/stash.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/master/stash.png\" alt=\"stash.png\" /></a></p>\n<h3>Skills</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/v2.2.0/skills.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/v2.2.0/skills.png\" alt=\"skills.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>- Update profile level</p>\n<p>- Update skills level</p>\n<p>- You guessed it, you will receive a message with the level changes</p>\n<h3>Traders</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/v2.2.0/traders.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/v2.2.0/traders.png\" alt=\"traders.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>- Update the reputation of the traders</p>\n<p>- Update the money spent on the traders</p>\n<p>- Same as before, a message is waiting for you</p>\n<h2><strong>Other</strong></h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/angel-git/give-ui/v3.0.0/other.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/angel-git/give-ui/v3.0.0/other.png\" alt=\"other.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>- Set season</p>\n<p>- Add stash rows</p>\n<p>- Receive gifts</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2187, "published_at": "2024-11-26T20:50:26.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1617/give-ui/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1028, "published_at": "2024-12-18T12:19:33.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1617/give-ui/2.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1365, "published_at": "2025-03-17T11:48:14.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1617/give-ui/3.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.2.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 10492, "published_at": "2025-05-25T20:14:53.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1617/give-ui/3.2.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1892, "published_at": "2025-10-08T09:10:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1617/give-ui/3.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "4.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 4605387, "dow